{\b\fs22 Libre Line}\par
\i Some tickets don't expire.\i0\par
\par
A community online server compatible with {\i Ticket to Ride} Classic for PC (published by Asmodee under licence from Days of Wonder).\par
\par
{\b This project is unofficial and unaffiliated.} It is not endorsed, authorised or supported by Asmodee or Days of Wonder. {\i Ticket to Ride} is their trademark, used here only to say what this server is compatible with. The project exists only for compatibility and preservation, in the spirit of the Stop Killing Games initiative (https://www.stopkillinggames.com/).\par
\par
Libre Line doesn't change the game. Its "Set up my game" button changes one line in the game's settings file (customAsyncServerName), and "Undo" puts it back. Players sign in with their own Asmodee accounts; nothing is unlocked.\par
\par
The installer adds a Windows Firewall rule so that other players can connect to the server, and the app can ask your router to forward the server's port (UPnP) while it runs. Both can be turned off.\par
